=== prompt
Count the Collatz steps for 6: while the number is not 1, halve it when even and otherwise replace it with 3n+1. Log the number of steps.
=== expected
8
=== reference
6 >= n
0 >= steps
While({n | IsNot(1)} {
  n | Math.Divide(2) = half
  If({half | Math.Multiply(2) | Is(n)} {half} {n | Math.Multiply(3) | Math.Add(1)}) > n
  Inc(steps)
})
steps | Log
